<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>If there’s less of earth joy,</l><l>Give, Lord, more of heaven.</l><l>Let the spirit praise Thee,</l><l>Though the heart be riven;</l><l>If sweet earthly ties, Lord,</l><l>Break at Thy decree,</l><l>Let the tie that binds us,</l><l>Closer, sweeter, be.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Lonely though the pathway,</l><l>Cheer it with Thy smile;</l><l>Be Thou my companion</l><l>Through earth’s little while;</l><l>Selfless may I live, Lord,</l><l>By Thy grace to be</l><l>Just a cleansed channel</l><l>For Thy life through me.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
